    <background>Buckle up Buttercup, you’re in for a ride\! You ever wanted to shoot zombie Nazi’s, ride space dinosaures, and liberate a cult? Sarge is a member of a mercenary company brought in by a mega corp. They gave a mission, a pile of creds up front and plausible deniability. They roll in right after act 1 ends. " A great crash echos through the burrow, as several buildings are brought down and are bull dozed into a makeshift wall. Slabs of armored steel are bolted together by a work detail of orcs and trolls while everyone else piles debris against the makeshift burm. A neon pink and yellow Kabuki mask adorns a slashed neon flag, rises from the newly formed wall. , as sarge punches through the concrete. With a desperate claw, he finds his kill crate. Stepping from it is Captain Lazlow, a man known for his achievements in war, recently replaced by the ageless, spirit within. a neon black centipede coming from the eye socket wrapped around like a scarf. The nickname for the company is the roaches, the company name is the Fuchsia Dragons.</background>
